!! Attacks

These also appear to have a 12-character limit. It's far more preferable to have brivla here, to be wrapped by nu.

(For example, I'm thinking of using "ko'a gasnu lo nu relpityda'i" for "[[pokemon] used doubleslap!")

__PLEASE MAKE SURE TO CHECK FOR CONSISTENCY BEFORE SUBMITTING TRANSLATION.__ If you don't like the way something's translated, communicate it via [mailto:jandew+lojban@gmail.com|email].

